WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
01  CHOOSE YOUR PACK. Choose labels for the things that go to school.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
02  LABEL + CONNECT. Apply the right label. Activate its private code.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
03  REPORT A LOST BELONGING. A student submits a lost-item report in FindBox.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
04  SCAN + SEND THE FIND. Scan with a phone. Submit the report to your school.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
05  YOUR SCHOOL COLLECTION POINT. Staff receive it, verify the match and notify the owner.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
06  BACK WHERE IT BELONGS. Collect during opening hours. Staff confirm the handover.